{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Demo version of Desktop Colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains a portion of the locations you can travel to and some of the prestige upgrades with much more in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Colony is a cosy, incremental,\u00a0idle-clicker colony simulator designed to sit on top of your desktop allowing you to work on other tasks while growing your space colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asteroid Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out probes to search for resources to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid increases your resources generated per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.poster.avif?t=1755178005\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.webm?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.mp4?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Ships and Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build habs to house more colonists and watch the ships fly around your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.poster.avif?t=1755178005\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.webm?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.mp4?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research strange artifacts and develop new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new types of asteroids and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your fledgling settlement from tiny backwater to bustling metropolis.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904780?t=1755178005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904780?t=1755178005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/06aa29b64977c494cd15fa9da29988b7748924ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755178005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/06aa29b64977c494cd15fa9da29988b7748924ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755178005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Demo version of Desktop Colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains a portion of the locations you can travel to and some of the prestige upgrades with much more in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Colony is a cosy, incremental,\u00a0idle-clicker colony simulator designed to sit on top of your desktop allowing you to work on other tasks while growing your space colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asteroid Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out probes to search for resources to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid increases your resources generated per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.poster.avif?t=1755178005\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.webm?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.mp4?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Ships and Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build habs to house more colonists and watch the ships fly around your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.poster.avif?t=1755178005\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.webm?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904780/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.mp4?t=1755178005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research strange artifacts and develop new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragra